Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: This needs U8, but the value is Int
  --> tests/ui/E0108_int_narrowing_lambda_return.jet:4:25
    |
  4 |     print(apply(fn(n) { n * 2 }, 5))
    |                         ^^^^^
 Why: The value here does not have the type required by this declaration
 Fix: Convert it with `checked(U8{value}) ?? fallback`; the conversion is `None` when the value doesn't fit in U8
